QUICK START
-----------
    git clone https://github.com/papichulo16/rootview.git
    cd rootview/src/ui/dynamic
    git checkout 2-webserver
    ./run.sh

Then open http://127.0.0.1:8000  — Ctrl-C to stop.


run.sh
-------------------------
Runs three commands 

    python3 -m venv .venv                     (only if .venv is missing)
    .venv/bin/pip install -e ".[dev]"         (only if pyproject.toml changed)
    .venv/bin/rootview-web                    (every time)


    ./run.sh --reload              auto-restart when you save a .py file
    ROOTVIEW_PORT=8080 ./run.sh    different port (8000 already in use?)
    .venv/bin/python -m pytest
